---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Projects" description="Projects, experiments, prototypes, and systems from The Ali Unseen.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">Projects</div>
      <h1 class="page-title">Ideas are more useful when they can be tested.</h1>
      <p class="lede">This is the build-in-public side of The Ali Unseen: prototypes, workflows, experiments, and systems that turn observations into something concrete.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid">
      <div class="card featured signal">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">Project index</div>
          <h3>Coming into focus</h3>
          <p>The first public project pages will be added here as the site is populated. Each entry will separate the idea, the problem being explored, what has actually been built, and what still needs validation.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="meta">Transparent maturity, not hype.</div>
      </div>
      <a class="card side" href="https://www.motyaali.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">Professional work</div>
          <h3>MotyaAli.com</h3>
          <p>The professional portfolio remains separate from this publication and creative identity.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="meta">Open portfolio →</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
